# Participant responses are never committed. Participants were told their answers
# would be used for the study, and the first ten saw wording that did not cover
# publication of their individual rows. Aggregate results go in results-interim.md.
data/
responses/

# Belt and braces: no JSON from anywhere under study/ unless force-added.
# elicitation/manifest.json is force-added on purpose — it describes the stimuli,
# not the people, and the study cannot be reproduced without it.
*.json
